        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Document</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: sans-serif;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n        color: #333;\n        background-color: #fff;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n    }\n    .container {\n        width: 100%;\n        max-width: 600px;\n        background-color: #fff;\n        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        min-height: 100vh;\n    }\n    .header {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        padding: 10px 20px;\n        border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\n    }\n    .header-left {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        gap: 10px;\n    }\n    .icon {\n        width: 24px;\n        height: 24px;\n        display: inline-block;\n        background-color: #f0f0f0;\n        border-radius: 50%;\n        text-align: center;\n        line-height: 24px;\n        font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    .header-title {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        color: #666;\n    }\n    .header-right {\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 15px;\n    }\n    .content {\n        padding: 20px;\n        flex: 1;\n    }\n    .list-item {\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n        position: relative;\n        padding-left: 25px;\n    }\n    .list-item::before {\n        content: \"◦\";\n        position: absolute;\n        left: 5px;\n        top: 0;\n        font-size: 18px;\n        color: #666;\n    }\n    .list-item p {\n        margin: 0;\n    }\n    .highlight-bg {\n        background-color: #e8f5e9;\n        padding: 5px 10px;\n        margin-top: 30px;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    h2 {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        color: #2e7d32;\n        margin: 0;\n        font-weight: normal;\n    }\n    h3 {\n        font-size: 16px;\n        color: #388e3c;\n        margin: 20px 0 10px 0;\n        font-weight: normal;\n    }\n    .bullet-list {\n        list-style-type: disc;\n        padding-left: 25px;\n        margin-top: 0;\n    }\n    .bullet-list li {\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n        color: #444;\n    }\n    .text-green {\n        color: #2e7d32;\n    }\n    .footer {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-around;\n        padding: 15px;\n        border-top: 1px solid #eee;\n        background-color: #fafafa;\n    }\n    .footer-icon {\n        width: 24px;\n        height: 24px;\n        border: 1px solid #ccc;\n        border-radius: 4px;\n        text-align: center;\n        line-height: 24px;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <div class=\"header-left\">\n            <span class=\"icon\">≡</span>\n            <span class=\"icon\">✏️</span>\n            <span class=\"header-title\">自我... / How to Org...</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"header-right\">\n            <span class=\"icon\">↑</span>\n            <span class=\"icon\">💬</span>\n            <span class=\"icon\">...</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n        <div class=\"list-item\">\n            <p>比如你记录了一个 💡想法，这个想法未来会运用到 撰写书籍里面。你就把这个想法放到撰写书籍📚的文件夹里。当你下次需要撰写书籍的时候，这些想法就可以帮助到你。</p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"list-item\">\n            <p>通未来的可行性整理你的内容，而不是客观的记录这个事件。</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"highlight-bg\">\n            <h2>D: Distill 提炼</h2>\n        </div>\n\n        <h3>Progressive Summarization 渐进式总结</h3>\n\n        <ul class=\"bullet-list\">\n            <li>它依赖于在一段时间内分多个阶段对笔记进行总结。<span class=\"text-green\">你只保存你所读的东西中最好的摘录，然后对这些摘录进行总结，再对该总结进行总结，在每个阶段提炼出内容的精髓。</span>这些“层”就像一张数字地图，可以放大或缩小到你需要的任何细节水平。</li>\n            <li>渐进式总结使你可以为不同的目的以不同的方式阅读笔记：如果你想收集每一个细节，就深入阅读，如果你只需要主要的收获，就在高层次上阅读。<span class=\"text-green\">这使你能够在几秒钟内审视笔记的内容，以决定它对手头的任务是否有用。</span></li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h3>Organize opportunistically 择机整理，一次一点</h3>\n\n        <ul class=\"bullet-list\">\n            <li>花费大量的时间来创建高度结构化、完美主义的笔记是很诱人的。问题是，你往往不知道哪些资料最终会有价值，直到很久以后。与其在前期投入大量精力，不如<span class=\"text-green\">适时地组织你的笔记，随着时间的推移一点点地整理。</span></li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n        <div class=\"footer-icon\">🔍</div>\n        <div class=\"footer-icon\">🔔</div>\n        <div class=\"footer-icon\">+</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
